omething can you put in a good word for  me that's a champion somebody who can  literally influence your career  and i believe that a great mentor is not  only outside your chain of command  sometimes they're completely outside  your industry in other words they don't  know the only thing they care about is  giving you good candid advice i believe  you cannot assign someone to be a mentor  just like you can't assign to people to  be friends right you two your friends  from now on like it's not gonna work  right it might work but it you can't  assign it  and so i i think mentor relationships  evolve like friendships just like my  friendship with wrong which is  i and i believe the definition of a  mentor is someone who always has time  for you
 

